Hi,

nice try, but it doesn't work on other OSes or distros. In my case, I have
a triple KO on Ubuntu 22.04 GNOME/Wayland, macOS and FreeBSD KDE/x11. The
idea is nice although it depends a lot on user QoE.

In my case, I cycle my themes with a keybinding (switching from
nordic-aurora to nordic-light) depending on what I need at any point in
time and without having to change the whole system appearance.

I'll keep a pointer for reference though, just in case -)

Best, /PA
